    "text": "A carbon resistor of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>56</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k&#937;</mi></math> is to be marked with rings of different colours for its identification. The colour code sequence will be",
